    "preamble": "P.K. Saish Babu vs The State Of Telangana on 9 September, 2024 Author: B. Vijaysen Reddy Bench: B. Vijaysen Reddy Honourable Sri Justice B. Vijaysen Reddy Writ Petition No.24807 Of 2024 Order :",
    "facts": "Mr. R. Laxmikanth Reddy, learned Assistant Government Pleader for Home, basing on the written instructions dated 06.09.2024, submitted that so far, there is no complaint registered/pending against the petitioner with respondent No.7 - the Station House Officer, Alwal Police Station. It is submitted that respondent No.7 never harassed, threatened, interfered, raided or seized the petitioner's products nor has taken any coercive action against him.",
